Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Shuttle-Spindle Drops the Shaft
- Story & Context: When a cable snapped on Lift Shaft 4 during a graveyard shift at the Kiruna iron deposit, rhythm-obsessed mechanic Tomasz didn’t panic; instead, he tuned his low-register timpani to the rhythmic, metallic clatter of the falling elevator frame. The resulting tape was smuggled into a Stockholm warehouse party by a local electrician, where the crowd went wild over the terrifying mix of free-jazz saxophone screams and 140 BPM pipe-thumping. The track captures the exact moment the metal jammed into the bedrock, resolving into a euphoric, high-altitude synth swell that lit up the dark. Tomasz’s rasping voice opens the track over a distorted cowbell: "She’s unraveling fast, so grab the iron spool!"
